question:
다음 SQL 문과 질의에 대한 결과 값으로 맞는 것은?

[테이블 생성 및 데이터 입력]
CREATE TABLE TEST(A INTEGER, B VARCHAR(10));
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (1, 'kim');
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (2, ' ');
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (3, NULL);
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (4, 'park');
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (5, NULL);
INSERT INTO TEST VALUES (6, 'lee');

[Oracle DBMS의 SQL]
```sql
SELECT X, X-Y, Z
FROM (
  SELECT COUNT(*) AS X,
         COUNT(B) AS Y,
         COUNT(CASE WHEN B IS NOT NULL
                     AND LTRIM(B) IS NULL
                    THEN '1' END) AS Z
  FROM TEST
) T;

```

[SQL Server DBMS의 SQL]
```sql
SELECT X, X-Y, Z
FROM (
  SELECT COUNT(*) AS X,
         COUNT(B) AS Y,
         COUNT(CASE WHEN B IS NOT NULL
                     AND LEN(LTRIM(B)) = 0
                    THEN '1' END) AS Z
  FROM TEST
) T;
```

트랜잭션 T1, T2, T3에 대하여 스케줄 s1, s2 중에서 충돌 직렬 가능한(conflict serializable) 것은?

[트랜잭션]
T1: r1(x); r1(z); w1(x);
T2: r2(z); r2(y); w2(z);
T3: r3(x); r3(y); w3(y);

[스케줄 s1]
r1(x); r2(z); r1(z); r3(x); r3(y);
w1(x); w3(y); r2(y); w2(z);

[스케줄 s2]
r1(x); r2(z); r3(x); r1(z); r2(y);
r3(y); w1(x); w2(z); w3(y);
